description_text:
Chinese horses painting porcelain/ceramic plate with wooden display stand. The stand is adjustable. Suitable for interior scenes, animation, games, mods or any real-time applications. The asset is detailed enough to allow close up shots.
The file included 1 round plate model and 1 stand model.
Poly Count before smooth:Plate Vertices: 496 Plate Polygons: 480 Stand Vertices: 4852 Stand Polygons: 4876
Plate Dimension : Diameter: 25 cmHeight: 2.4 cm
Stand Dimension : Width: 11.8 cm (folded) Height: 20 cm Thick: 1cm
Plate Texture Images : 4096px * 4096px (1)
Stand Texture Images :
2048px * 2048px (1) 4096px * 4096px (2)
Features : 

  - Renders without errors ;

  - Quads and triangles only ;

  - Fully textured ;

  - Real-world scale ;

  - Correctly named in English ;

  - Unwrapped and Clean UVs ;

Native application: Maya 2016 Preview images renderer: Maya Mental Ray 2016
Available formats: *.max 2018 (Arnold) *.maya 2016 (Mental Ray) *.cinema4d R16 *.obj *.fbx

The file includes an Air Fryer with separate basket and fries. The model was made looking for a balance between realism and a model without an exaggerated amount of polygons, so as not to compromise the rendering work. The model is great for composing the scene.
Dimensions of model:  X:27cm; Y:32,8cm; Z: 32cm

  - Air Fryer - poly: 2242, vertices: 2112; 

  - Basket -  poly: 1021, vertices: 991;

  - Fries - poly: 450, vertices: 500;

Textures - 4096 x 4096 quality:

  - Base color map;

  - Metallic map;

  - Specular map;

  - Roughness map;

  - Emissive map;

  - Opacity map;

  - Normal map.

Air Fryer and basket are separate objects.
Model with vertex groups.
The model was made in Blender. If you don't use this software, and if you have any problems with the material configuration, there's in the textures folder the configuration used for the materials to assist you.

Highly-detailed models, realistic renderings.

  - File formats: 3ds Max 2014 + Corona Renderer, fbx, obj, 3ds;

  - Ready for render: Corona Renderer 4 or higher;

  - Editable poly with Turbosmooth modifier;

  - All models, materials, textures included.

